## SQ-SMK-06 | Engineering items and blocks registered
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest reg item ^creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest reg block ^creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest item creativeengineering:precision_sawblade`
@pass 70 or more items (81 on 2026-11-15), 35 or more blocks (40); the sawblade is a `PrecisionSawbladeItem`
@fails A startup items script not run (KubeJS registry), `CreativeEngineeringItems` not registered
@sources development/creativeEngineering
@tier T1
> cdevtest reg item ^creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest reg block ^creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest item creativeengineering:precision_sawblade
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=\S+ n=([7-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2,})\b
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+ n=(3[5-9]|[4-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2,})\b
expect verb=item item=creativeengineering:precision_sawblade class=com\.SaintAlfonzo\.creativeengineering\.items\.PrecisionSawbladeItem

## SQ-SMK-07 | Engineering recipes and the dragon breathing type
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest recipes creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest bytype creativeengineering:dragon_breathing max=1`; `/cdevtest makes creativeengineering:iron_wire`
@pass 1300 or more `creativeengineering` recipes (1394 in the 2026-11-19 dump; 1804 before the 2026-11-17 namespace binding moved recipes to their owning jars); 10 or more dragon breathing recipes (14); at least one recipe makes iron wire
@fails Server scripts not in the jar (`data/creativeengineering/kubejs/`), the dragon breathing serializer not registered
@sources development/creativeEngineering
@tier T1
> cdevtest recipes creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest bytype creativeengineering:dragon_breathing max=1
> cdevtest makes creativeengineering:iron_wire
expect verb=recipes text=creativeengineering: n=(1[3-9]\d\d|[2-9]\d{3}|\d{5,})\b
expect verb=bytype serializer=creativeengineering:dragon_breathing n=([1-9]\d+)\b
expect verb=makes item=creativeengineering:iron_wire n=[1-9]\d*\b

## SQ-SMK-09 | Equipment boots: loaded line, script pack, data packs, mixins
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/latest.log` for `[creativeequipment]` and `[jar-startup] creativeequipment`; count `from creativeequipment.mixins.json` in `logs/debug.log`
@pass `[creativeequipment] loaded (config/creativeequipment-common.toml)`; `core finished`; `mod data packs on:`; `N of N files loaded from its jar`; jar found; at least one mixin applied; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `creativeequipment`
@fails Jar missing, a mixin target renamed (shields, armor bar, backpacks), a startup script throwing
@sources development/creativeEquipment
@tier T1
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativeequipment\] loaded \(config/creativeequipment-common\.toml\)
bootexpect \[creativeequipment\] core finished
bootexpect \[creativeequipment\] mod data packs on:
bootexpect \[jar-startup\] creativeequipment: (\d+) of \1 files loaded from its jar
bootreject /ERROR\].*\bcreativeequipment\b
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|MixinTransformerError).*\bcreativeequipment
shell grep -q "Found valid mod file creativeequipment-[^ ]*\.jar with .creativeequipment." logs/debug.log
shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from creativeequipment.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from creativeequipment.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-11 | Equipment recipes and the stepstool tag
