@fails pair not loaded (startup `pneumaticcraft/item_merges.js` requires both mods); `already merged` warning
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@sources feature_writeup/veggies_delight.md
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> cdevtest makes pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips
> cdevtest uses pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips
> cdevtest makes veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips
> pbot spawn mg21 110 -60 506 minecraft:overworld survival
> give mg21 pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips 2
sleep 3
> clear mg21 veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips 0
> clear mg21 pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips 0
expect verb=makes item=pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips n=0
expect verb=uses item=pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips alone=0 shared=0
# r1120lr batch fault: n=3 = creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/fish_and_chips + its Slice & Dice mirror + the salting recipe (recipes/all.csv 2026-11-19); verb=makes prints id= result=, not '->'
expect verb=makes item=veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips n=3\b
expect verb=makes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/fish_and_chips result=
